### GET all credentials
GET http://localhost:5142/creds

###

### GET a specific credential (1 = Biking in Miscallaneous)
GET http://localhost:5142/creds/1

###

### CREATE a credential in Work (CategoryId 4)
POST http://localhost:5142/creds
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ServiceName": "Jira",
    "Username": "rich",
    "Password": "1234567",
    "CategoryId": 4
}

###

### CREATE a credential whose name already exists in the same category -> expect 409 Conflict
### "Google" already exists in Work (CategoryId 4)
POST http://localhost:5142/creds
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ServiceName": "Google",
    "Username": "duplicate",
    "Password": "1234567",
    "CategoryId": 4
}

###

### CREATE a credential reusing a name from a DIFFERENT category -> allowed (201)
### "Netflix" exists in Home/Shopping but not in Social Media (CategoryId 5)
POST http://localhost:5142/creds
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ServiceName": "Netflix",
    "Username": "rich.social",
    "Password": "1234567",
    "CategoryId": 5
}

###

### UPDATE a credential (1 = Biking) - rename + new password
PATCH http://localhost:5142/creds/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ServiceName": "Mountain Biking",
    "Password": "newpass123"
}

###

### MOVE a credential to another category via update (CategoryId only)
PATCH http://localhost:5142/creds/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "CategoryId": 3
}

###

### DELETE a credential (1 = Biking)
DELETE http://localhost:5142/creds/1
